WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Observe: Remember the contents and original positions of both cases.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Goal 1: Move the case containing the USB drive to the left tray.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:01:14.000
Goal 2: Move the case containing the SD card to the right tray.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:50.767
Goal 3: Return the USB case to its original position.
